diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index ff92be649ff3f610b38798b3310751534d032814..d70a5600b9b0f7bebed90ce2d1f2fadd3228b33f 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -3,3 +3,8 @@
 A small TypeScript library, with no runtime dependency, of building blocks for our services that store,
 exchange and update JSON: configuration files, API payloads and stored records. It is imported by the
 other projects of the team, so its behaviour must follow the published standards it implements.
+
+## JSON Pointer
+
+`resolvePointer(document, pointer)` resolves values using [RFC 6901 JSON Pointer](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6901).
+It returns the input document for the empty pointer, decodes `~0` and `~1` in reference tokens, and throws when the pointer is invalid or cannot be resolved.
